### Create payout (idempotent: first call)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: abc-123
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "amount": 1000,
  "currency": "ZAR",
  "destination": { "type": "bank_account", "last4": "1234" },
  "metadata": { "order_id": "ORD-1001" }
}

### Create payout (idempotent: same key returns same record)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: abc-123
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "amount": 1000,
  "currency": "ZAR",
  "destination": { "type": "bank_account", "last4": "1234" }
}

### Create payout (new key -> new payout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: def-456
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "amount": 2500,
  "currency": "ZAR",
  "destination": { "type": "bank_account", "last4": "9988" }
}
